# Keep docker build contexts small: don't ship node_modules, build output, or local tool caches.
# The build stage reinstalls deps from pnpm-lock.yaml, so a fresh node_modules is deterministic.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github
docs
infra/compose/grafana/dashboards
# Logs, tmp files
**/*.log
.DS_Store
